# Used automatically by BuildKit for linux/docker/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Keep the context small: only sources the port compiles or installs.
# Keep the exceptions in step with the data the port stages, installs and
# tests with (src/CMakeLists.txt nppgtk_data, cmake/Install.cmake,
# tests/panels_test.cpp).
.git
**/build
**/build-*
dist
obj-*
debian/.debhelper
debian/notepad-plus-plus-gtk
debian/tmp
*.deb
PowerEditor/bin/*
!PowerEditor/bin/userDefineLangs
PowerEditor/visual.net
PowerEditor/gcc
PowerEditor/installer/*
!PowerEditor/installer/themes
!PowerEditor/installer/nativeLang
!PowerEditor/installer/functionList
!PowerEditor/installer/APIs
!PowerEditor/installer/filesForTesting
.pc
